{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_113_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_113","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，晉人、衞人、陳人、鄭人伐宋。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_113_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_113","textTraditional":"二、夏四月癸亥，葬我小君聖姜。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_113_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_113","textTraditional":"聖姜者何？文公之母也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_113_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_113","textTraditional":"三、齊侯伐我西鄙。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_113_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_113","textTraditional":"四、六月癸未，公及齊侯盟于穀。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_113_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_113","textTraditional":"五、諸侯會于扈。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_113_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_113","textTraditional":"六、秋，公至自穀。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_113_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_113","textTraditional":"七、公子遂如齊。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}